            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>The station gets a hull, and the bay hangs outside it</li>
<li>A prop fades into the hands and fades out of them</li>
<li>A body's props are rebuilt, not switched on and off</li>
<li>Three simulator names nothing presses</li>
<li>Two extractions that paid nothing</li>
<li>A teammate's closed pull request leaves the station</li>
<li>The simulator is a board you set up and a move you play</li>
<li>The gallery plays the station's own routines, not a copy of them</li>
<li>The bay is a honeycomb of berths, and no two shuttles fly in alike</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
